Install
	iZotope_VEA_v1_0_2.dmg
Replace file from Intel Replace
	/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/VEA.vst3/Contents/Resources/iZVEA.bundle/Contents/MacOS/
	/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/iZVEAAUHook.component/Contents/Resources/iZVEA.bundle/Contents/MacOS/
To get AAX
Copy
/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/iZVEAAUHook.component/Contents/Resources/iZVEA.bundle
to
/Library/Application Support/Avid/Audio/Plug-Ins

Open terminal

sudo codesign --force --deep --sign - /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/iZVEAAUHook.component/Contents/Resources/iZVEA.bundle/Contents/MacOS/iZVEA
sudo codesign --force --deep --sign - /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/VEA.vst3/Contents/Resources/iZVEA.bundle/Contents/MacOS/iZVEA

Done